@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Trisha's Profile";
}

@section Styles{
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/wwwroot/css/Index.css" />
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome to my profile!</h1>
    <p>You will see my profile and future works on this webpage.</p>
</div>
<div class="text-left">
    <h2>What can you expect from this site?</h2>
    <p>This site will showcase my blogs in my life, as well as my latest projects. So stay tuned!</p>
    <hr />
    <h3>My First Experience</h3>
    <p>Designing your own website can be difficult at first, but you will easily get it one by one if you know the concepts.</p>
</div>
<div class="blog-card">
    <div class="blog-image-wrapper">
        <img src="~/Images/Screenshot 2026-10-09 170953.png" alt="Blog Post Topic" asp-append-version="true" />
    </div>

    <div class="blog-information">
        <h4 class="blog-title">Trying to Make My First Calculator</h4>
        <p>I have dreams making a simple project but I always hesitate whether it will go or not. So, I tried building a Python calculator and fortunately, it worked.</p>
        <p>I will try more but first, this is the calculator with exponent operation.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .blog-card {
    display: flex;
    background-color: #001b85;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) 0 4px 15px;
    margin: 30px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #0290c6;
}

.blog-image-wrapper{
    flex: 0 0 35%;
    min-width: 250px;
    background-color:#fadcdc;
}

.blog-image-wrapper img{
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
}

.blog-information{
    padding: 26px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: 1;
}

.blog-title{
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    color: #fadcdc;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 100px;
    font-family: 'Franklin Gothic Medium', 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 22px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    color: #58cdfa;
    background-color: #001b85;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
}
</style>